cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pyplotrs in work you publish, please cite it."
title: pyplotrs
abstract: >-
  A publication-quality plotting library for Python with a Rust rendering core.
  Produces PDF whose text stays embedded, selectable and editable rather than
  outlined, alongside SVG, PNG and self-contained HTML.
type: software
